//!   - EPWM_DC_WINDOW_SOURCE_DCAEVT2  - DC filter signal source is DCAEVT2
//!   - EPWM_DC_WINDOW_SOURCE_DCBEVT1  - DC filter signal source is DCBEVT1
//!   - EPWM_DC_WINDOW_SOURCE_DCBEVT2  - DC filter signal source is DCBEVT2
//!
//! \return None
//
